internal/botagent

This directory contains code derived from bot-agent
(github.com/more-than-code/bot-agent), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A copy of that licence is in LICENSE in this directory.

Source commit: 040a7bd947ace45036b32b02585d531845f65f4a (2026-11-15)
Source paths:  internal/agent/{conn,spool,redact,config,policy}

The files were modified for Defect Drainer's dd-worker (2026-11-15). Each
package's doc comment lists its changes. In summary:

- conn:   the frame limit, envelope and version come from this
          module's workerproto package; encoding/json replaces bot-agent's
          protocol.Marshal. Backoff, Dial (redirects refused) and frame IO
          are unchanged.
- spool:  ids are worker protocol ids instead of UUIDs (the google/uuid
          dependency is dropped); a full spool refuses a frame instead of
          dropping the oldest; age is enforced only by DropOlderThan; Bytes
          is added.
- redact: encoding/json replaces protocol.Marshal; CmdlineMax is local;
          Exact.Values (exact values only, no keyword regex) and Exact.Empty
          are added.
- config: DD_WORKER_* keys and /etc/dd-worker, /var/lib/dd-worker paths;
          the server is an https origin; no environment overlay; the join
          token is read from stdin and never stored; WriteFileAtomic is
          exported.
- policy: the key set is a caller-supplied schema; a scalar string is
          accepted; bot-agent's keys and the passwd/group resolution are
          dropped. The file checks (root owner, mode, size, SHA-256) and the
          value parsers are kept.

Tests were adapted to the changes above.
